    <string name="about_title">Field Kit %1$s</string>
    <string name="about_what">First aid, knots and a compass that work with no signal. Location is used only for the compass and your position, on this phone. The emergency card stays on this phone too, and goes on the lock screen only if you switch that on. A note you start in Patient assessment stays on the phone until you clear it. The app has no internet access.</string>
    <string name="about_aid">First-aid pages written from current guidance: US government sources (MedlinePlus, CDC, NPS and others), the AHA and Red Cross first-aid guidelines, and the Wilderness Medical Society, each named on its page. They do not replace training.</string>
